                          "<CWD>")
  -w, --workspace <path>  workspace path override (relative to monorepo root)
  -h, --help              display help for command
",
  "update": "Usage: update [options] [components...]

update installed components to the latest registry version

Arguments:
  components              component name(s) to update. If omitted, shows an
